<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Prabin Gharti Magar - Myagdi, Nepal</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            /* Full-page Himalayan mountain background with dark overlay for crisp white text */
            background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(10, 15, 28, 0.62), rgba(10, 15, 28, 0.72)), 
                              url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544735716-392fe2489ffa?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            background-attachment: fixed;
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            color: #ffffff;
            line-height: 1.7;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* Header Section */
        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 56, 147, 0.85) 0%, rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.85) 100%);
            backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3rem 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        }

        .flag-container {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .nepal-flag {
            width: 80px;
            height: auto;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.4));
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            opacity: 0.95;
        }

        /* Main Container */
        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 2.5rem auto;
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
        }

        /* Transparent Sections Blending Directly With Mountain Background */
        .transparent-section {
            background: transparent;
            padding: 1.5rem 0;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
        }

        .transparent-section:last-of-type {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .transparent-section h2 {
            color: #ffffff;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #DC143C;
            padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);
        }

        .transparent-section p {
            color: #f3f4f6;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            text-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
        }

        /* Photo Gallery Section */
        .photo-wrapper {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }

        .village-photo {
            width: 100%;
            max-height: 450px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        .caption {
            margin-top: 0.8rem;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #e5e7eb;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
        }

        /* Map Section */
        .map-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            padding-bottom: 56.25%; /* 16:9 Aspect Ratio */
            height: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-top: 1.2rem;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        .map-container iframe {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            border: 0;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            background-color: rgba(10, 15, 28, 0.85);
            color: #d1d5db;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header with Nepal Flag & Name -->
    <header>
        <div class="flag-container">
            <!-- Official Flag of Nepal SVG -->
            <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9b/Flag_of_Nepal.svg" 
                 alt="Flag of Nepal" 
                 class="nepal-flag">
        </div>
        <h1>Prabin Gharti Magar</h1>
        <p>From the scenic hills of Myagdi, Nepal</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        
        <!-- About Me Section (No white background) -->
        <section class="transparent-section">
            <h2>About Me</h2>
            <p>
                Namaste! My name is <strong>Prabin Gharti Magar</strong>. I am proud to hail from 
                <strong>Myagdi District</strong> in Gandaki Province, Nepal. Growing up surrounded by 
                majestic mountains, lush green hills, and rich Magar culture has shaped who I am today.
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Hometown & Ruma Gaun Photo Section (No white background) -->
        <section class="transparent-section">
            <h2>My Hometown: Ruma Gaun, Myagdi</h2>
            <p>
                <strong>Ruma Gaun</strong> is a peaceful and picturesque village nestled in the hills of Myagdi. 
                Known for its stunning Himalayan views, terraced fields, and warm community spirit, it is a place 
                I always call home.
            </p>
            <div class="photo-wrapper">
                <!-- Replace 'ruma-gaun.jpg' with your actual local photo file path -->
                <img src="ruma-gaun.jpg" 
                     onerror="this.src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585409677983-0f6c41ca9c3b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80'" 
                     alt="Scenic view of Ruma Gaun, Myagdi, Nepal" 
                     class="village-photo">
                <p class="caption">Scenic landscape of Ruma Gaun, Myagdi, Nepal</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Nepal & Myagdi Map Section -->
        <section class="transparent-section">
            <h2>Explore Myagdi on the Map of Nepal</h2>
            <p>
                Myagdi lies in the western hills of Nepal, serving as a gateway to the Dhaulagiri mountain range.
            </p>
            <div class="map-container">
                <iframe 
                    src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d449567.8923564844!2d83.21853685!3d28.53237315!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x39be1d1b0f94b63b%3A0x673992e80c82c7d7!2sMyagdi!5e0!3m2!1sen!2snp!4v1700000000000" 
                    allowfullscreen="" 
                    loading="lazy" 
                    referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade">
                </iframe>
            </div>
        </section>

    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 Prabin Gharti Magar | Proudly from Myagdi, Nepal 🇳🇵</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
